Package: CustomBEDCalculator
Type: Application
Title: HNSCC BED Calculator with Early and Late Toxicity
Version: 4.2.0
Author: Igor Shuryak
Maintainer: Igor Shuryak <is144@cumc.columbia.edu>
Description: A Shiny application computing tumor BED under dose-independent and
    dose-dependent repopulation models, early and late toxicity BED, and a search
    for hypofractionated regimens meeting tumor and toxicity criteria.
